quiz.prompt:
The night light is on in the light and stays off in the dark. The wiring is correct (LDR on top, 10 kΩ at the bottom). Which line has the bug?

```
int isik = analogRead(A1);
int parlaklik = map(isik, KARANLIK, AYDINLIK, 0, 255);
parlaklik = constrain(parlaklik, 0, 255);
analogWrite(11, parlaklik);
```

SICAK_SINIR = 40.0, sicaklik = 42.5 and the calculated parlaklik = 120. When this code runs, what do the lamp (D11) and the warning LED (D13) do?

```
if (sicaklik > SICAK_SINIR) {
  parlaklik = 0;
  digitalWrite(13, HIGH);
} else {
  digitalWrite(13, LOW);
}
analogWrite(11, parlaklik);
```
